            <div xml:id="d220">

                <pb facs="0228" n="218" xml:id="pg218"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.3531/523: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Weddell</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-10-06T17:00:00-04:00">October 6, 1937—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received October 6—4:17 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>190. Department’s telegram No. 92, October 5, 2 p.m. I delivered the confidential
                    memorandum to the Minister for Foreign Affairs today and expect to discuss it
                    with him tomorrow.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Weddell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
